OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will begin dry with
OL,6,Fsunny spells in Shetland but cloudy
OL,7,Fwith rain across Orkney. Cloud and
OL,8,Frain soon spread to Shetland but clear
OL,9,Facross Orkney during the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FEvening rain over Shetland,
OL,12,Fotherwise dry with clear spells. A
OL,13,Ffurther rain band will push east
OL,14,Facross the Northern Isles towards
OL,15,Fmorning.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FCloudy with rain at times
OL,18,Fduring the morning. The rain and cloud
OL,19,Fclear east by midday, leaving the
OL,20,Fafternoon dry with sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
