OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FDry
OL,6,Fbut hazy with the odd bright spell
OL,7,FWednesday into Thursday morning. A
OL,8,Fband of cloud and rain pushes east
OL,9,Flater Thursday afternoon, clearing by
OL,10,FFriday morning. Dry Friday afternoon.
